        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: A Scholar Under Siege\n- People: Michael Braz\n- Organizations: Georgia Southern University, University System of Georgia\n- Topics: opera, libretto, higher education\n\nFacts:\n- Georgia Southern University was founded in 1906 as a land-grant college.\n- Georgia Southern University is part of the University System of Georgia.\n- Georgia Southern University is the largest center of higher education in the southern half of Georgia.\n- A Scholar Under Siege is an opera in two acts by contemporary American composer Michael Braz.\n- Michael Braz wrote the English-language libretto for A Scholar Under Siege.\n- A Scholar Under Siege was composed for the centenary of Georgia Southern University.",
